  "instructions": [
    "Roast the poblanos in the oven at 400 degrees Fahrenheit for 30 minutes.",
    "Peel the roasted poblanos and chop them into large pieces.",
    "Heat the oil in the iron teppan over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped cilantro and cook until it is wilted.",
    "Add the roasted poblanos, tomato paste, and vegetable broth to the teppan.",
    "Stir in the coconut cream and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the birria simmer for 10 minutes."
